% tokens (closed-world sort checking)
a: type.
b: type.
a2: type.
m: type.
b2: type.

% till fused ≡ fissioned fixture (E7.3, round-13 testing residue v): a
% single delayed step {b}@5 versus an explicit intermediate with 2+3 on
% disjoint atoms. The E7.3 theorem: both settle to the SAME final stamp.

fused: a -o { b }@5.

fiss1: a2 -o { m }@2.
fiss2: m -o { b2 }@3.
